.TH TDUWEB-SELFTEST 1 "September 24, 2026" "darpa_spillserver 1.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tduweb-selftest \- self-test for the TDU web server, runnable on the TDU
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python2.5
.B contrib/tduweb/selftest.py
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B selftest.py
checks the parts of
.BR tdu_webserver (1)
that have no other safety net. It imports
.I tdu_webserver.py
from its own directory with
.B TDU_WEB_NO_SERVE
set, so no socket is opened and a running server is not disturbed.
.PP
The groups of checks, each printed with an
.B ok
or
.B FAIL
line per case, are:
.TP
.B JSON encoder
Literal expected output for scalars, strings, escapes, non-ASCII and nested
containers. Compared as text, not round-tripped through a parser, because
Python 2.5 has no
.B json
module.
.TP
.B History CSV parsing
Rows of
.B DumpSpillHistory
CSV output, including the stray leading comma it writes.
.TP
.B Shared-memory failure detection
Error text from the dump tool is reported as a failure, not as data.
.TP
.B Listen port
The argument, then
.BR TDU_WEB_PORT ,
then the default, with bad values ignored.
.TP
.B Command timeout
A hung helper command is killed rather than hanging the server.
.TP
.B Large output
Output past the cap is truncated, not read into memory.
.TP
.B Empty ring slots
Unused slots, which decode as type 0, are not reported as NuMI events.
.PP
It is written to the same Python 2.5 floor as the server. It needs
.I bottle.py
on the path.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PYTHONPATH
Must reach
.I bottle.py
when run from this repository rather than from
.IR TDUWeb/server/ .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
All checks passed.
.TP
.B 1
At least one check failed; each is listed.
.SH EXAMPLES
On the TDU, beside the installed server:
.PP
.RS
.EX
python2.5 ./selftest.py
.EE
.RE
.PP
On a development machine, with the 2.6+ builtins hidden:
.PP
.RS
.EX
PYTHONPATH=/path/to/TDUWeb/server TDU_WEB_NO_SERVE=1 \e
    python2 contrib/tduweb/run_as_python25.py contrib/tduweb/selftest.py
.EE
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tdu_webserver (1),
.BR tduweb-check-python25 (1),
.BR tduweb-run-as-python25 (1)
